          "definition": "To threaten, menace, or warn of evil.",
          "usage_conditions": "This Form IV usage is specifically associated with threatening; its verbal noun إِيعَادٌ and the noun وَعِيدٌ denote the threat or threatening.",
          "source_refs": [
            "lane:entry:45453",
            "mufradat:row:1591"
          ]
        }
